#: src/main.ui:60
msgid "Face models"
msgstr "Modely tváre"

#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Snímky vašej tváre, s ktorými sa porovnáva Ubuntu Hello. Ponechajte si aspoň "
"dva, zaznamenané pri rôznom osvetlení."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Zobrazujú sa uložené modely pre:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Je zaregistrovaný iba jeden model tváre. Okuliare, zmena fúzov alebo iné "
"osvetlenie menia to, ako kamera vidí vašu tvár, takže jediný model môže "
"zlyhať (napríklad večer pri svetle lámp). Pridajte druhý model s okuliarmi "
"alebo bez nich, s vaším druhým vzhľadom alebo v inom svetle, aby odomykanie "
"zostalo spoľahlivé."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Pridajte druhý model"

